{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1514711-ghost-bustin-evocations","id":1514711,"title":"Ghost Bustin' Evocations","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-06-12T09:26:47-07:00","id":1514711,"title":"Ghost Bustin' Evocations","content":"Migrating over from Reddit...<br /> <br /> I got some help in building evocations for an artifact I'm working on (a pair of smashfists). I had originally wanted to try and figure out a way of basically giving my Solar an equivalent to Ghost-Eating Technique without dipping into Occult, because he had no real reason to buy the dots, but I've been convinced because I wanted to make the weapons out of Jade and if I'm being completely objective, even if the weapons are never going to fall into the hands of a Terrestial, giving them a way to access a GET equivalent is bad mojo.<br /> <br /> So I'm working off of something that instead has GET as a prerequisite to further Evocation charms. The problem is, I don't actually know what else I could do with it. I'm not super creative especially with regards to 3E, and I am having trouble figuring out what an Evocation could offer in terms of expanding out laterally from Spirit-Cuttng Attack and Ghost-Eating Technique.<br /> <br /> Something I DO know I want is for the artifact to offer something essentially similar to the Zenith anima power for a non-Zenith, and the artifact is basically built around fighting/interacting with ghosts specifically compared to gods or elementals. Is anyone here good at lateral thinking and can offer me some ideas for how to flesh this artifact and its evocations out?<br /> <br /> I've got a good idea of the fluff behind it, I just need the crunch.<br /> <br /> (Can provide a picture of what the artifact looks like if requested.)\u200b<br /> <br /> (Changed this from the Solars subforum to the main.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2023-tsukai","name":"Tsukai","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T14:01:08-07:00","id":1514754,"title":"","content":"Design them around the lyrics of the Ghostbusters theme song.<br /> <br /> I'm not kidding. Make the capstone a permanent upgrade to the smashfists that allows you to cross the streams: you can choose for any decisive attack to roll damage against both yourself and whatever ghost you're fighting, but the ghost's soak doesn't apply, and the dice pool against you is halved if you destroy the ghost with your attack. Make an Evocation that allows you to strengthen your positive ties and/or Intimacies after defeating a ghost because bustin makes you feel good. Stuff like that. You'll come up with ideas the more you sing to yourself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-13T02:57:33-07:00","id":1514814,"title":"","content":"What is the fluff? I have possible ideas for the crunch but I'm not sure if they reconcile with your vision.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-13T07:57:37-07:00","id":1514845,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1514711-ghost-bustin-evocations?p=1514814#post1514814\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What is the fluff? I have possible ideas for the crunch but I'm not sure if they reconcile with your vision.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Loom of Fate foresaw the possibility that an otherwise accomplished martial artist would have a great destiny in defense of Stygia, but was otherwise un-versed in the ways of ghosts, so in order to reinforce the chances the Gold Faction constructed these for him by retrofitting and updating an otherwise historical pair of white jade smashfists used by Antonio Mendoza his previous incarnation, with starmetal taken from soulforging an old rival of his, a lesser god of Watchet Squalls, and silk scarves dyed in the blood of a hekatonhire. The Solar was notoriously unwilling to take up a weapon so had to be convinced this was just a 'martial aid', and underwent Gold Faction training (and a lot of mind expanding drugs) to unlock his spiritual sight.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2023,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2023-tsukai","user":"Tsukai","date":". 06-14-2023, 05:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2023-tsukai","name":"Tsukai","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}